  "title": "RealityBridge: Bridging Editable 3D Gaussian Splatting Driving Simulations and Real-World Videos",
  "summary": "RealityBridge addresses the Sim-to-Real gap in edited 3DGS driving videos by combining multimodal controls and lightweight GateNet for adaptive condition allocation, while improving artifact removal, illumination, and temporal consistency. It outperforms existing methods in safety and realism.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "RealityBridge uses multimodal controls including rendered videos, foreground masks, edge maps, and semantic masks for enhanced restoration.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "It introduces autoregressive long-video training with reward-guided post-training to improve restoration quality and temporal stability.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
